# superfix_cc.c: superfix_area_reach, libg's own area target test (circle, InnerRadius ring, RequireLineOfSight through the
# tile map's line test 0xa56dc0 / 0xa56398), for host-applied Stun / Silence areas and the new ones; HpBasedStun 43 (Meeple's
# RageQuit) stuns by its owner's missing HP; Angelo's SwitchSkill weapon swap (superfix_cc_switch).
# superfix_status.c area_extra: ChargeSuper 18 / GiveUlti 57 (Max's hypercharge), EnragerOverchargeSuper 32 (Edgar: reload
# and super charge), SwitchSkill 33 (Angelo), BulletSpin 40 (Darryl), HotAndOverheals 45 (Pam's turret as Hot).
# superfix.c: Max's hypercharged drinks (max_drinks); a summon's own CharacterData AreaEffect (superfix_summon_area) and a
# summon Hot area's heal. spawnfix.c: MeepleWallSpawn 42 / GladiatorWallSpawn 55 walls. gadget.c: Fang's sweep, Painter's
# push and Meeple's RageQuit as AREA gadgets. env.c my_charge: Edgar's super charge percent.
# Paths relative to engine/.
